# skyeCladachBoat — the boat at the jetty head, Skye
#
# The way off the island: leaving the tutorial for the main adventure.
# Asks, never assumes -- a player wandering down the jetty to look at the
# sea shouldn't find themselves rowing to Ireland.
#
# NOTES USED
#   leave_skye  -> one-off trigger; the scene clears it and starts the
#                  crossing back (returnCrossing -> d3_sea)
#
# IRISH IS A FIRST DRAFT -- check before shipping.

@file skye/skyeCladach
@encounter 1


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
= node 0 — the boat
@hold
The boat that brought you here.
% An bád a thug anseo thú.
It would take you back across the sea.
% Thabharfadh sé ar ais thar farraige thú.

* Leave the island.
% Fág an t-oileán.
@note leave_skye
@exit

* Not yet.
% Ní fós.
@exit
